================================================================================
TASK 6 — Systemd: Mask and Enable Services (3 points)
================================================================================
Mask the cups service and ensure ssh is enabled (it already is).

On node02:
1. Mask cups service (systemctl mask cups).
2. Ensure ssh is enabled (systemctl enable ssh).
3. Verify with systemctl is-enabled.

