TASK 7 — Monitoring/ps: Count Bob Processes (3 points)
================================================================================
Count processes of user bob and save the number.

On node02:
1. Use pgrep or ps to count processes owned by bob.
2. Save the number (only the number) to /opt/bob-procs.txt.

