Run on node01: bash /home/vagrant/generate-evidence.sh

================================================================================
SCORING SUMMARY
================================================================================
Task 1:  3 pts (du/tar)
Task 2:  3 pts (Users/Groups)
Task 3:  3 pts (btrfs)
Task 4:  3 pts (journald)
Task 5:  3 pts (Sticky bit)
